---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';

import {
	SITE_DESCRIPTION,
	SITE_TITLE
} from '../consts';
---


<!doctype html>

<html lang="en">


<head>

<BaseHead
	title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
	description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}
/>

</head>


<body>


<Header />


<main>



<section class="intro">


<h1>
About
</h1>


<p>

Neo Blog is a place to record
things worth keeping.

</p>


</section>





<section>


<h2>
Why
</h2>


<p>

This blog is not only a place
to publish articles.

</p>


<p>

It is a personal knowledge system
for recording:

</p>


<ul>

<li>
What I learn
</li>

<li>
What I build
</li>

<li>
What I discover
</li>

<li>
What I think
</li>

</ul>


</section>





<section>


<h2>
Categories
</h2>



<h3>
Trading
</h3>


<p>

Recording trading ideas,
market observations,
and lessons from decisions.

</p>





<h3>
工具人系列</h3>


<p>

Recording problems,
solutions,
and experiences from daily life.

</p>





<h3>
随笔
</h3>


<p>

Recording thoughts
that become clearer over time.

</p>



</section>





<section>


<h2>
Approach
</h2>


<p>

Learn through experiments.

Build systems instead of relying on motivation.

Keep improving through consistency.

</p>


</section>




</main>




<Footer />



</body>

</html>





<style>


main {

	width:
	calc(100% - 2rem);


	max-width:
	720px;


	margin:
	auto;


	padding:
		4rem 0;

}



section {

	padding:
		1rem 0 2rem;

}



.intro {

	padding-bottom:
		3rem;

}



h1 {

	font-size:
		2.8rem;

}



h2 {

	margin-top:
		2rem;

}



h3 {

	margin-top:
		1.5rem;

}



p {

	line-height:
		1.8;

	color:
	rgb(var(--gray-dark));

}



li {

	margin-bottom:
		0.8rem;

	line-height:
		1.6;

}


</style>